From 8d626b28de95fe83770b8baa8035a0044a0a8d19 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bob <robertramsay78@googlemail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 19:44:32 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Lite and Pro: the same features - ADAM Pro adds extra example
 games and lessons

pro_on() and feature_gate() (the feature switches) are always on, so ADAM
Lite gets BOBs, bigger sprites, gradients and dither patterns too.
pro_edition() / pro_gate() now only gate the Pro extras: Pro example games
and lessons show 'ADAM Pro' in Lite and say where to get them. Edition chip,
About page and CLAUDE.md say so.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BQFSzGarhTTpK2DHf8XzFr
